WEBVTT

00:00.700 --> 00:04.950
In twenty seventeen, eight researchers wrote one paper.

00:06.700 --> 00:10.300
Their idea? Stop reading word by word.

00:13.600 --> 00:17.900
Let every word pay attention to every other word.

00:18.300 --> 00:19.400
All at once.

00:21.500 --> 00:25.650
That one idea now powers the AI you use every day.

00:25.800 --> 00:26.950
Agentic.

00:27.100 --> 00:29.650
Uncovering how AI works.
